Title: More arrests over Eyres Monsell stabbing
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Det Sgt Adrian Davies', 'Text': '"We believe the stabbing happened shortly before 9.15pm,"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 56}}, {'Speaker': 'Det Sgt Adrian Davies', 'Text': '"It was still light at that time and with the weather being very warm there were probably quite a few people who were in the area or in their gardens.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 141}}, {'Speaker': 'Det Sgt Adrian Davies', 'Text': '"If you saw something or heard something that might help with our investigation, please contact us."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 86}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Police have arrested four more people over a stabbing outside a house in Leicester.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 72}}, {'Description': 'Officers were called to Lawford Road, in Eyres Monsell, shortly after 21:15 BST on Friday after a man in his 20s was stabbed on Sturdee Road.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 137}}, {'Description': 'Following the arrest of a 36-year-old woman on suspicion of attempted murder, Leicestershire Police said it had arrested two men aged 18 and 29 on suspicion of the same offence.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 171}}, {'Description': 'A 38-year-old woman was also arrested on suspicion of conspiracy to commit murder, and a third woman, aged 25, on suspicion of assisting an offender.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 135}}, {'Description': 'The 18-year-old man and the 25-year-old woman remain in police custody while the other three suspects have been released on police bail while investigations continue.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 137}}, {'Description': 'A spokesperson for the police said the injured man had made his way to Lawford Road following the stabbing and was taken to hospital, where he remained in a stable condition.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 153}}, {'Description': 'Police said the suspects and the man were known to each other.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 56}}, {'Description': 'The force added house-to-house inquiries were under way and a "thorough examination" of the scene had been carried out.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A general street view of Sturdee Road in Leicester'}]}
